name: optimize-queries
description: Eliminate N+1 queries in Django
---

Optimize these Django queries to prevent N+1:

Current code:
{{ input }}

Apply these techniques:
- select_related() for ForeignKey, OneToOne fields
- prefetch_related() for ManyToMany and reverse relations  
- only() and defer() for specific fields
- values() or values_list() when full objects not needed
- annotate() and aggregate() for calculations
- Use exists() instead of count() > 0
- Use update() for bulk operations

Return optimized code with comments explaining changes.